  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyPolicyLastUpdated": "Last updated: June 11, 2026",
  "privacyPolicyContent": "Agroecology Map AI is a free software platform for querying agroecological knowledge with AI.\n\nData We Collect:\n- Full name, email, and hashed password for account access\n- Preferred language/locale\n- Optional profile data: bio, external link, and avatar\n- Document suggestion comments and uploaded files, when you choose to submit them\n- IP address in transient request logs for security and debugging\n\nLocal Storage:\nThe app may store session data, language preference, and recent chat history on your device.\n\nLocal AI Processing:\nAI models and embeddings run locally or on infrastructure controlled by the project. Questions, chat history, embeddings, and documents are not sent to external AI APIs.\n\nWe DO NOT collect advertising IDs, browsing history, background location, contacts, payment information, or sensitive personal data.\n\nData Sharing:\nWe do not sell, rent, trade, or share your personal data with advertisers, data brokers, external analytics services, or external AI providers.\n\nYour Rights:\nYou can export your data, edit your profile, delete your account, request portability, and withdraw consent by stopping use or deleting your account.\n\nAccount Deletion:\nUse 'Delete My Account' in your profile. A confirmation email is sent. Once confirmed, personal data is permanently anonymized and sessions are terminated.\n\nMobile Privacy:\nThe app does not request camera, microphone, contacts, or location access. Photo library access may be requested only when you choose a profile avatar; only the selected image is uploaded. The app has no third-party analytics SDKs and uses HTTPS.\n\nContact and DPO: contact@agroecologymap.org\nLicense: GPLv3 (Free Software)\nRepository: https://codeberg.org/agroecologymap",
  "termsOfServiceTitle": "Terms of Service",
  "termsOfServiceLastUpdated": "Last updated: June 11, 2026",
  "termsOfServiceContent": "1. Acceptance of Terms\nBy creating an account and using Agroecology Map AI, you agree to these Terms of Service.\n\n2. Description of Service\nAgroecology Map AI is a free software AI chat platform for querying agroecological knowledge. AI models and embeddings run locally or on infrastructure controlled by the project, without external AI APIs.\n\n3. User Accounts\nYou are responsible for your account credentials. You must provide accurate registration information. Minimum age: 16 years.\n\n4. Acceptable Use\nDo not use the platform for illegal purposes, submit harmful content, attempt to disrupt service, use automated means without permission, or misrepresent your identity.\n\n5. User Content\nBy submitting content, you grant the platform a non-exclusive license to display it within the platform. You retain ownership.\n\n6. Intellectual Property\nThe software is GPLv3 licensed. Document content retains its original licenses.\n\n7. Disclaimer\nThe platform is provided 'AS IS'. AI-generated answers may not be accurate. Always verify with primary sources.\n\n8. Limitation of Liability\nThe project and its volunteers are not liable for damages arising from platform use to the extent permitted by law.\n\n9. Account Termination\nAccounts violating these terms may be suspended. Users may delete accounts at any time.\n\n10. Modifications\nTerms may be updated. Material changes communicated via email.\n\n11. Governing Law\nGoverned by the laws of Brazil.\n\n12. Contact\ncontact@agroecologymap.org",
